 "cards": [
  {
   "id": "k0",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 现代 GPU 的架构\n\nGPU 由一组高度多线程化的 SM 组成。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k1",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## thread block 调度\n\nblock 整块分给一个 SM。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k2",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 同步与透明可扩展性\n\n同一 block 的线程用 barrier 协调。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k3",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## barrier 应尽量限制在较小范围\n\n范围越大，等待越多。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k4",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 错误使用 __syncthreads() 的示例\n\nif 和 else 各放一个。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k5",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## thread block cluster\n\ncluster 范围的 barrier。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k6",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## grid 范围同步\n\n开销高于 block 和 cluster。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k7",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## Intrinsic Function\n\n__syncthreads 是 intrinsic。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k8",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## __syncthreads tricky 的地方\n\n每处调用都是独立的同步点。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k9",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## Wave\n\n同时执行的一组 block。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k10",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## Warp\n\n32 个线程一组。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k11",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 线程布局\n\nrow-major 展平再切。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k12",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## GPU 中的 SIMD 硬件设计\n\n一条指令跑整个 warp。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k13",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## Wrap 控制流分歧\n\n分支要分遍跑。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k14",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 检查是否会造成控制流分歧\n\n看判定条件。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k15",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 控制流分歧: if-else\n\n两边各跑一遍。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k16",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## Warp 调度与延迟容忍\n\n等内存时换一个 warp。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k17",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 资源划分与占用率\n\noccupancy。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k18",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 性能悬崖初探\n\n多用一个寄存器就掉一截。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k19",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 查询设备属性\n\ncudaGetDeviceProperties。",
   "look": "note"
  },
  {
   "id": "k20",
   "kind": "note",
   "md": "## 使用 cudaDeviceProp\n\n按资源上限调参。",
   "look": "note"
  }
 ],
