 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "T",
   "title": "计算架构",
   "x": 1807,
   "y": 25,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "summary": {
    "text": "SM 按 block 调度、barrier 只在块内，warp 是执行单位：**两层调度**决定了并行怎么写。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "6xxhx8",
    "input": "18x5zhd"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "P",
   "title": "GPU 架构初探",
   "x": 1807,
   "y": 25,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "T",
   "directSummary": {
    "text": "barrier 分三层：block 内用 __syncthreads()，cluster 和 grid 用 Cooperative Groups，**范围越大开销越高**。同时执行的一批 block 叫 wave。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "168owk6",
    "input": "zup2zm",
    "title": "同步层次与 wave"
   },
   "summary": {
    "text": "SM 按块调度，barrier 只在块内，**换来透明扩展**。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "1rq89ny",
    "input": "smzkcp"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "title": "SM 与 block 调度",
   "x": 63,
   "y": 25,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "P",
   "summary": {
    "text": "线程以 **thread block 为单位**分到 SM，同一 block 的线程落在同一个 SM 上，能用 barrier 和 shared memory **低延迟协作**。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "vlv11c",
    "input": "23juqf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "title": "barrier 与透明扩展",
   "x": 1203,
   "y": 25,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "P",
   "summary": {
    "text": "barrier 只限在 block 内，不同 block 就能按任意顺序执行，程序在大小不同的 GPU 上**透明扩展**。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "11bne2j",
    "input": "1ckhfdf"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "title": "__syncthreads 误用示例",
   "x": 2382,
   "y": 671,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "P",
   "summary": {
    "text": "if 和 else 两边各放一个 __syncthreads()，其实是**两个同步点**，行为未定义。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "cn58uf",
    "input": "7qjbax"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "W",
   "title": "WARP 执行",
   "x": 1703,
   "y": 1700,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "T",
   "summary": {
    "text": "warp 一起跑、分支分遍跑，靠**多驻留 warp** 盖住延迟。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "74ocjc",
    "input": "1bt95fc"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w1",
   "title": "WARP 与 SIMD 硬件",
   "x": 1703,
   "y": 1700,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "W",
   "summary": {
    "text": "block 按 32 个线程切成 **warp**，是 SM 的调度单位；SIMD 让一条指令同时跑整个 warp。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "1m0wvwo",
    "input": "1g4fjbk"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w2",
   "title": "WARP 控制流分歧",
   "x": 2994,
   "y": 1700,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "W",
   "summary": {
    "text": "同一 warp 的线程走不同分支时，硬件要**分遍执行**，每遍只有部分线程活动。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "x7pc8o",
    "input": "bba54w"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "w3",
   "title": "WARP 调度、延迟、占用率",
   "x": 2808,
   "y": 2902,
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "parent": "W",
   "summary": {
    "text": "一个 warp 等内存时调度器**零开销**切到另一个，靠 warp 多来盖住延迟。",
    "at": 1700000000000,
    "sig": "1y3hfl2",
    "input": "1m8whgx"
   }
  },
  {
